---
import { ArrowRight, Mail } from "@lucide/astro"
---

<section class="bg-background py-section" aria-labelledby="cta-final-heading">
  <div
    class="mx-auto w-full max-w-landing px-container-x sm:px-8 xl:px-14 flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center gap-7 text-center"
  >
    <h2
      id="cta-final-heading"
      class="max-w-heading text-balance text-headline-2 leading-tight font-semibold text-foreground"
    >
      Lleva Terraltura a tu barra, tu mesa o tu cocina.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-base text-muted sm:text-lg">
      Descubre nuestras cuatro variedades o escríbenos si representas una
      cafetería, un restaurante o una distribuidora interesada en trabajar con
      nosotros.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        class="inline-flex min-h-12 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold no-underline transition duration-200 ease-landing focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-border border-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-emphasis active:bg-emphasis"
        href="#productos"
      >
        Descubre nuestro café
        <ArrowRight
          aria-hidden="true"
          width="18"
          height="18"
          stroke-width="1.5"
        />
      </a>
      <a
        class="inline-flex min-h-12 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold no-underline transition duration-200 ease-landing focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-border border-0 bg-control text-foreground hover:bg-control-hover active:bg-control-hover"
        href="#contacto"
      >
        Hablar con Terraltura
        <Mail aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="1.5" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
